@page "/"

<PageTitle>Draftline</PageTitle>

@* The editor's three regions, as the shell draws them: the blocks on the left, the canvas in the
   middle, the properties of the selected block on the right. This story builds the frame; the
   palette and the real blocks arrive with the canvas story, the inspector with the export story. *@
<div class="draftline-editor">
    <aside class="draftline-side draftline-side--palette" aria-label="Блоки">
        <FlareText Element="h2" Typo="TypographyScale.TitleMedium">Блоки</FlareText>
        <FlareText Element="p" Typo="TypographyScale.BodySmall" Color="FlareColor.OnSurfaceVariant">
            Палитра low-fi блоков появится здесь.
        </FlareText>
    </aside>

    <section class="draftline-canvas-host" aria-label="Холст макета">
        <div class="draftline-canvas">
            <FlareText Element="p" Typo="TypographyScale.BodyMedium" Color="FlareColor.OnSurfaceVariant">
                Пустой холст
            </FlareText>
        </div>
    </section>

    <aside class="draftline-side draftline-side--inspector" aria-label="Свойства">
        <FlareText Element="h2" Typo="TypographyScale.TitleMedium">Свойства</FlareText>
        <FlareText Element="p" Typo="TypographyScale.BodySmall" Color="FlareColor.OnSurfaceVariant">
            Инспектор выбранного блока появится здесь.
        </FlareText>
    </aside>
</div>
